message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LCBR: Local Conflict-Based Trajectory Repair for Multi-UGV Coordination"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Batbaina"
date-released: "2026-08-11"
license: MIT
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Stage 1 -- UGV Coordination and Task Allocation"
  authors:
    - name: "Batbaina"
  year: 2026
references:
  - type: software
    title: "CL-CBS: Car-Like Conflict-Based Search"
    authors:
      - name: "Licheng Wen"
      - name: "Zhen Zhang"
      - name: "Zhe Chen"
      - name: "Xiangrui Zhao"
      - name: "Yong Liu"
    url: "https://github.com/APRIL-ZJU/CL-CBS"
    notes: >
      LCBR is built directly on top of CL-CBS's low-level search
      (hybrid_astar.hpp, unmodified) and high-level BCT structure.
      This project's contribution is the local repair mechanism
      (include/local_repair.hpp) and the Stage 1+2 nominal
      trajectory generation + task allocation pipeline
      (include/task_allocation.hpp) that CL-CBS does not have.
